/**
 * CAD AND TECHNICAL DRAWING.
 *
 * The CAD track. Tool-agnostic on purpose: the concepts (constraints, design
 * intent, mates, drawing views, tolerance annotation) transfer directly between
 * FreeCAD, Onshape, Fusion 360 and SolidWorks, and a robot project lives long
 * enough that you may change tools mid-build.
 *
 * Every lesson ends in something you can measure or assemble, because a model
 * that has not been printed, fitted or dimensioned has not been tested.
 *
 * DAG: cad-01 -> cad-02 -> cad-03 -> cad-04 -> cad-05
 */
